## Browser gate run 1 (AC-5.3, AC-5.2, AC-8.2)

- Command: `bash apps/storytime/__tests__/phase3-browser-gate.sh`.
- Result: exit 1; `PASS=3, FAIL=1`.
- The Playwright step failed before any app row: `Error [ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND]: Cannot find package '@playwright/test' imported from /tmp/storytime-browser-dfZ2iK/gate.mjs`.
- Cause: the gate writes `gate.mjs` under `mktemp -d -t` in `/tmp`. Node resolves `@playwright/test` from that folder and finds no `node_modules` above it. The package exists at the repository root, so the app is not at fault.

